#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:55
msgid "Cloud Detail View"
msgstr "Nube Detail Ver"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:57
msgid ""
"The Cloud Detail view shows metrics on health, sync status, current month"
" costs, average monthly costs, resource utilization statistics, and "
"resource counts for Container Hosts, Hypervisors, Bare Metal, Virtual "
"Machines, and Unmanaged resources."
msgstr ""
"El Nube Detail ver muestra metrics en health, sync estado, actual month "
"costs, average monthly costs, recurso utilization statistics, y recurso "
"counts para Contenedor Hosts, Hypervisors, Bare Metal, Máquinas "
"virtuales, y Unmanaged recursos."

