#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:61
msgid ""
"To view the Cloud List View, select the name of a Cloud to display the "
"clouds Detail View."
msgstr ""
"A ver el Nube List Ver, seleccionar el nombre de un Nube a display el "
"clouds Detail Ver."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:63
msgid "EDIT"
msgstr "EDIT"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:64
msgid "Edit the setup configuration of the Cloud."
msgstr "Editar el setup configuración del Nube."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:65
msgid "REFRESH"
msgstr "REFRESH"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:66
msgid ""
"Force a sync with the Cloud. Depending on the Cloud, choose to force a "
"standard Cloud sync (occurs every five minutes by default) or a nightly "
"sync. When syncing Costing data, |morpheus| will force a pull of costing "
"data for your specified period. If opting to \"rebuild\" the costing "
"data, |morpheus| will delete all costing data from the Cloud for that "
"period and attempt to rebuild the data by calling the Cloud API."
msgstr ""
"Force un sync con el Nube. Dependiendo de el Nube, elegir a force un "
"estándar Nube sync (occurs cada five minutes por defecto) o un nightly "
"sync. Cuando syncing Costing datos, |morpheus| será force un pull de "
"costing datos para su specified period. Si opting a \"rebuild\" el "
"costing datos, |morpheus| será eliminar todos costing datos desde el Nube"
" para ese period y attempt a rebuild el datos por calling el Nube API."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:67
msgid "DELETE"
msgstr "DELETE"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:68
msgid "Delete the Cloud from |morpheus|"
msgstr "Eliminar el Nube desde |morpheus|"

