#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:73
msgid "Cloud Detail Tabs"
msgstr "Nube Detail Tabs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:75
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:75
msgid "Not all tabs are available for all Cloud Types."
msgstr "No todos pestañas están disponibles para todos Nube Tipos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:77
msgid "Clusters"
msgstr "Clústeres"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:78
msgid ""
"The Clusters tab displays clusters provisioned into the Cloud being "
"viewed, including their status, type, name, layout, workers, and compute,"
" memory, and storage stats. You can add a cluster by clicking "
":guilabel:`ADD CLUSTER`."
msgstr ""
"El Clústeres pestaña muestra clusters aprovisionado en el Nube being "
"viewed, incluyendo su estado, tipo, nombre, layout, workers, y compute, "
"memoria, y storage stats. You puede agregar un cluster por clicking "
":guilabel:`ADD CLUSTER`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:79
msgid "Hosts"
msgstr "Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:80
msgid ""
"The Hosts tab displays available hosts in the Cloud and displays power, "
"OS, name, type, cloud, IP address, nodes, disk space, memory, and status."
" You can add a resource by clicking :guilabel:`ADD RESOURCE`, add a "
"hypervisor host by clicking :guilabel:`ADD HYPERVISOR`, or perform action"
" an action by selecting one or more Hosts and clicking "
":guilabel:`ACTIONS`."
msgstr ""
"El Hosts pestaña muestra disponible hosts en el Nube y muestra power, OS,"
" nombre, tipo, cloud, IP dirección, nodos, disco space, memoria, y "
"estado. You puede agregar un recurso por clicking :guilabel:`ADD "
"RESOURCE`, agregar un hypervisor host por clicking :guilabel:`ADD "
"HYPERVISOR`, o perform acción un acción por selecting one o más Hosts y "
"clicking :guilabel:`ACCIONES`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:81
msgid "VMs"
msgstr "VMs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:82
msgid ""
"Displays an inventory of existing Instances in your Cloud configuration "
"and provides details such as power, OS, name, type, cloud, IP address, "
"nodes, disk space, memory, and status."
msgstr ""
"Muestra un inventory de existente Instancias en su Nube configuración y "
"proporciona details como power, OS, nombre, tipo, cloud, IP dirección, "
"nodos, disco space, memoria, y estado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:83
msgid "Bare Metal"
msgstr "Bare Metal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:84
msgid ""
"Setup PXE Boot in the Boot section to add bare metal servers. Once set up"
" you can view information such as power, OS, name, type, cloud, IP "
"address, nodes, disk space, memory, and status."
msgstr ""
"Setup PXE Boot en el Boot sección a agregar bare metal servidores. Once "
"establecer up you puede ver información como power, OS, nombre, tipo, "
"cloud, IP dirección, nodos, disco space, memoria, y estado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:85
msgid "Security Groups"
msgstr "Grupos de seguridad"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:86
msgid ""
"The Security Groups tab displays a list of existing security groups in "
"the cloud. You can add a security group to this cloud by clicking "
":guilabel:`EDIT SECURITY GROUPS`."
msgstr ""
"El Grupos de seguridad pestaña muestra un lista de existente security "
"groups en el cloud. You puede agregar un security group a este cloud por "
"clicking :guilabel:`EDIT SECURITY GROUPS`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:87
msgid "Load Balancers"
msgstr "Balanceadores de carga"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:88
msgid ""
"The load balancers tab panel displays available load balancers in the "
"cloud including the name, description, type, cloud and host. You can add "
"a load balancer from this tab by clicking :guilabel:`ADD LOAD BALANCER`."
msgstr ""
"El load balancers pestaña panel muestra disponible load balancers en el "
"cloud incluyendo el nombre, descripción, tipo, cloud y host. You puede "
"agregar un load balancer desde este pestaña por clicking :guilabel:`ADD "
"LOAD BALANCER`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:89
msgid "Networks"
msgstr "Redes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:90
msgid ""
"Displays Networks synced or added to the Cloud, including their name, "
"type, CIDR, pool, DHCP status, visibility and targeted Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Muestra Redes sincronizado o agregado al Nube, incluyendo su nombre, "
"tipo, CIDR, pool, DHCP estado, visibility y targeted Inquilino."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:91
msgid "Data Stores"
msgstr "Datos Stores"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:92
msgid ""
"Displays Datastores synced or added to the Cloud, including their name, "
"type, capacity, online status, visibility, and targeted Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Muestra Almacenes de datos sincronizado o agregado al Nube, incluyendo su"
" nombre, tipo, capacidad, online estado, visibility, y targeted "
"Inquilino."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:93
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "Recursos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:94
msgid ""
"Displays Resource Pools synced from the Cloud, including their name, "
"description, and targeted Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Muestra Pools de recursos sincronizado desde el Nube, incluyendo su "
"nombre, descripción, y targeted Inquilino."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:95
msgid "Policies"
msgstr "Policies"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:96
msgid ""
"Manages Policies enforced on the Cloud. Setting a policy on this tab is "
"equal to creating a policy in |AdmPol| and scoping it to the selected "
"Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Gestiona Policies enforced en el Nube. Setting un política en este "
"pestaña es igual un creating un política en |AdmPol| y scoping it al "
"seleccionado Nube."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:97
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "Profiles"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:98
msgid ""
"Manages |profileTypes| Profiles that create custom object associated "
"secrets and metadata that will automatically be mapped per Cloud "
"selection during provisioning and automation."
msgstr ""
"Gestiona |profileTypes| Profiles ese crear personalizado object "
"associated secrets y metadata ese será automáticamente be mapeado per "
"Nube selection durante provisioning y automation."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:101
msgid "Deleting Clouds"
msgstr "Deleting Nubes"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:103
msgid "To delete a cloud:"
msgstr "Para eliminar un cloud:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:105
msgid "Select the Infrastructure link in the navigation bar."
msgstr "Seleccionar el Infraestructura enlace en el barra de navegación."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:106
msgid "Select the Clouds link in the sub navigation bar."
msgstr "Seleccionar el Nubes enlace en el sub barra de navegación."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:107
msgid "Click the Delete icon of the cloud to delete."
msgstr "Click el Eliminar ícono del cloud a eliminar."

#: ../../infrastructure/clouds/clouds.rst:109
msgid ""
"All Instances, managed Hosts and VMs must be removed prior to deleting a "
"Cloud. To remove Instances, hosts and VMs from |morpheus| without "
"deleting the Cloud resources they represent, select Delete on the host or"
" VM, unselect \"Remove Infrastructure\", and select \"Remove Associated "
"Instances\" if Instance are associated with the selected Hosts or VMs."
msgstr ""
"Todos Instancias, administrado Hosts y VMs debe be eliminado prior a "
"deleting un Nube. A eliminar Instancias, hosts y VMs desde |morpheus| sin"
" deleting el Nube recursos they represent, seleccionar Eliminar en el "
"host o VM, unselect \"Eliminar Infraestructura\", y seleccionar "
"\"Eliminar Associated Instancias\" si Instancia son asociado con el "
"seleccionado Hosts o VMs."

